  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tatpartaa: Increasing Responsiveness to Child Labor &amp; Forced Labor in the Context of Climate Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TheTatpartaa(the Nepali word for commitment and ability to respond) project in Nepal will build the capacity of local communities to address child labor and forced labor, with a specific focus on confronting new challenges resulting from the impact of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
